Sky metal is metal thought to be blessed upon [[Færrin]] by the Outer Gods or by other powerful beings. [[Geography/The Quorum|The Quorum]] on the [[Geography/Star 221,325|Joker World at Star 221,325]] is built of a black sky metal, reflective and formed at least in part by magic.
